### 1. Login ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@uniajc.edu.co", "password": "Admin123*" }

> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Registrar estudiante (publico)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "jperez", "email": "jperez@uniajc.edu.co", "password": "Clave123*" }

### 3. Login estudiante
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "jperez@uniajc.edu.co", "password": "Clave123*" }

> {% client.global.set("estudiante", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Usuario autenticado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{estudiante}}

### 5. Crear torneo como ESTUDIANTE -> 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/torneos
Authorization: Bearer {{estudiante}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Copa Interfacultades 2026", "disciplina": "Fútbol", "fechaInicio": "2026-11-10", "fechaFin": "2026-12-05" }

### 6. Crear torneo como ADMIN -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/torneos
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Copa Interfacultades 2026", "disciplina": "Fútbol", "fechaInicio": "2026-11-10", "fechaFin": "2026-12-05" }

> {% client.global.set("idTorneo", response.body.idTorneo); %}

### 7. Disciplina invalida -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/torneos
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Torneo raro", "disciplina": "Quidditch", "fechaInicio": "2026-11-10", "fechaFin": "2026-12-05" }

### 8. Listar torneos con filtros
GET http://localhost:8080/api/torneos?disciplina=Fútbol&estado=PLANIFICADO
Authorization: Bearer {{estudiante}}

### 9. Iniciar torneo (ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/torneos/{{idTorneo}}/iniciar
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 10. Iniciar otra vez -> 409
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/torneos/{{idTorneo}}/iniciar
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 11. Cerrar torneo (ADMIN)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/torneos/{{idTorneo}}/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 12. Roles (solo ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 13. Sin token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/torneos
